    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Technomancy sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use a sphere effect which summons, creates, or animates a construct, you may create a sprite inside one of these constructs as a free action. If you possess Sprite Legion, you may generate sprites in any number of such targets, up to your maximum number from Sprite Legion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/technomancy#toc46\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
